				"defaultKind": "omitted",
				"description": "CLI token usage for one run: a finite, non-negative reportedCostUsd is returned as the exact cost, and otherwise inputTokens and outputTokens must both be non-null. Omitted usage, cacheReadTokens (alone or with cacheWriteTokens) above inputTokens, or cacheWriteLongTokens above cacheWriteTokens make the quote unavailable, while null cache counts widen the range rather than counting as zero.",
